   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWEDESD Swedish International Centre of  Education for Sustainable Dev</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regeringen har genom beslut (UD2006/48225/UTSTYR) givit Sida i        uppdrag att finansiera etablerande av verksamhet f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbart l&#xe4;rande vid H&#xf6;gskolan p&#xe5; Gotland. Verksamheten g&#xe5;r under namnet Swedish       International Centre of Education for Sustainable Development         (SWEDESD).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Sweden has assigned Sida to finance a centre for    education for sustainable development at the University of Gotland.   The name of the centre is Swedish International Center of Education   for Sustainable Development (SWEDESD).</narrative>
  </description>
